<title>LATVIA: Yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills fell on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.84	  3.92	 4	    0.5   0.9  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  4.05	  4.26	 6	    1.0   3.0  1.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
